(7786011, 1291070, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> Great capture, but not one of my favorites.  I feel like most voters are probably using their phones these days, and there is a lot going on here to convey on a small screen.  It is an interesting image, and I think you meet the challenge well.  
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> I think a different crop may have grown your score a bit here.  When my eye first sees the image, I feel like I am searching for the subject.  The blurred background grabs me before the subject does.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> 5.8xx is not a bad score by any stretch.  This would have gotten a 5 or 6 from me, so I think it scored about where it should have.  Thanks for sharing!
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: Great capture, but not one of my favorites.  I feel like most voters are probably using their phones these days, and there is a lot going on here to convey on a small screen.  It is an interesting image, and I think you meet the challenge well.  

My ideas for improvement:  I think a different crop may have grown your score a bit here.  When my eye first sees the image, I feel like I am searching for the subject.  The blurred background grabs me before the subject does.

Where I would have/did score this entry: 5.8xx is not a bad score by any stretch.  This would have gotten a 5 or 6 from me, so I think it scored about where it should have.  Thanks for sharing!

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-04 11:39:31.000000', NULL, 0);
